+ IconCard is Box

+ name String

────────────────────
+ This
    - name

────────────────────

<This • icon-card flex-col flex:1 p:10
    + <VectorImage • flex:1

    <Label • h:22 mt:5
        text = name
        text-alignment = TextAlignment.center
